  "albumInformation": "<p>Civilized make their WFMU debut by rifling through a belligerent set of new songs off their latest EP <em>Dust and Blood</em>, out on <a href=\"http://www.ihateyouthattack.com/2014/02/89-civilized-dust-and-blood-ep/\" target=\"_blank\">Youth Attach Records</a>.</p>\n<p>For more info and interview, check out the <a href=\"http://wfmu.org/playlists/shows/56863\" target=\"_blank\">playlist</a>.</p>\n<p>Set List:</p>\n<p>1. Apparition</p>\n<p>2. Downcast</p>\n<p>3. All the Same</p>\n<p>4. Numb </p>\n<p>5. Hammer</p>\n<p>6. Crossed</p>\n<p>7. Wallflower </p>\n<p>8. Fracture</p>\n<p>9. Die Off</p>\n<p>10. Pedestal</p>",
